    ${tile("Decisions pending",IN(cPend.length+po.length+lvP.length+bigDisc.length),"across four queues")}</div>
   <div class="two" style="margin-bottom:18px">
    <div class="packnote"><h4>What the board should note this month</h4>
     <p>The group billed ${money(rev)} across ${IN(brs.length)} branches and kept ${money(net-cost)} after
     running cost, a margin of ${margin}%. ${collEff}% of what was billed has actually been collected, leaving
     ${money(totDue)} outstanding of which ${money(due90)} is older than ninety days. The single issue worth
     board time is ${problem}. Beyond that, ${money(unearned)} of service has been paid for and not yet delivered
     \u2014 that is a promise on the books, not profit, and it needs clinic diaries rather than a finance fix.</p></div>
    ${gauge(health,"Group health index",
     "Blends collection efficiency, contribution margin, active client share and receivable ageing into one score out of 100.")}</div>
